      "side": 1,
      "message": "To make this code more maintainable with regards to handling conflicts with LTS updates, can we do this at the top of the function instead:\n\n```\nstatic inline bool platform_pci_power_manageable(struct pci_dev *dev)\n{\n  bool ret \u003d false;\n  \n  trace_android_vh_platform_pci_power_manageable(dev, \u0026ret);\n  if (ret)\n    return ret;\n  ...\n```\n\nIt doesn\u0027t look like `pci_use_mid_pm()` or the ACPI call will affect the result if the tracepoint returns false.",
